  "notes": "SessionSifu 3.5.20 serializes launch, window-layout and Recall screenshot operations across the GNOME extension, cancels stale restore callbacks and retains incomplete window layouts. Normal restore and Recall remain enabled. Update the GNOME integration and log out/in once to load the changes. The hardware-specific shutdown cause remains under investigation."
